[View: ProjectIssues]
route: /:workspaceSlug/projects/:projectId/issues
memory:
  - Row containers use dynamic ids (issue_<uuid>) — offline matcher cannot key on [id^=]; only the title link is stably selectable
  - Each row carries ~13 unlabeled dropdown buttons (state, priority, dates, assignee) with no stable hooks — they stay T2 under WorkItemList
  - Clicking a work item title navigates to /:workspaceSlug/browse/:workItem (full page), not a modal

